    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Even <U+0010><U+0003>ጂ<U+0002><U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>က<U+0010><U+0002>Ċ<U+0002> seems\nmore<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nvaluable<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nafter<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbeing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmy<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npossession.",
