      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose I could share a\nbit of my riches with you. <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200073007500700070006F007300650020004900200063006F0075006C006400200073006800610072006500200061000A0062006900740020006F00660020006D007900200072006900630068006500730020007700690074006800200079006F0075002E002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Even in hyperspace the SBC is generous. So have\nthese <U+0010><U+0001>ခ<U+0010><U+0002>Ċ<U+0002>.",
